					<div id="mw-content-text" class="mw-body-content"><div class="mw-pt-translate-header noprint nomobile" dir="ltr" lang="en"><a href="/w/index.php?title=Special:Translate&amp;group=page-Wikidata%3ASPARQL+query+service&amp;action=page&amp;filter=&amp;action_source=translate_page" title="Special:Translate">Translate this page</a>; This page contains <span class="plainlinks"><a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Wikidata:SPARQL_query_service&amp;oldid=2444045411&amp;diff=2551846291" href="https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Wikidata:SPARQL_query_service&amp;oldid=2444045411&amp;diff=2551846291">changes</a></span>. Please contact a <a href="/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Wikidata:Translation_administrators" title="Special:MyLanguage/Wikidata:Translation administrators">translation admin</a> to mark them for translation.</div><div class="mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable" lang="en" dir="ltr"><div class="mw-pt-languages-label">Other languages:</div><ul class="mw-pt-languages-list"><li><a href="/wiki/Wikidata:SPARQL_query_service/id" class="mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high" title="Wikidata:Layanan kueri SPARQL (92% translated)" lang="id" dir="ltr">Bahasa Indonesia</a></li>
